{
  "name": "Runic Juggernaut",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn how to amplify your rune-powered transformation. As a result, the extra damage you deal with the Giant's Might feature increases to 1d10. Moreover, when you use that feature, your size can increase to Huge, and while you are that size, your reach increases by 5 feet.</p><p>Additionally, you now regain the use of your Giant's Might feature on a Short or a Long Rest.</p>",
